#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:72
msgid "Best Practices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:74
msgid ""
"Grant ``Manage Rules`` access to operations teams that need to update "
"firewall rules without modifying the integration structure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:75
msgid ""
"Use ``Group`` access for router permissions when multiple teams share an "
"|morpheus| tenant but manage separate network infrastructure"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:76
msgid ""
"Restrict ``Full`` access to network security integrations to senior "
"network administrators"
msgstr ""

#: ../../infrastructure/networks/security/security_roles.rst:77
msgid ""
"Use ``Read`` access for auditors or compliance personnel who need "
"visibility without modification capability"
msgstr ""

